---
permalink: /_redirects
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#- Cloudflare Pages redirect rules (GitHub Pages serves this as an inert file). Stored copies and ledger
    archives moved to R2 under content-hashed keys, so the old repo paths that were cited, bookmarked, or
    exported in CSV/JSON 301 to the current object. Generated from the URLs the mirror writes. -#}
{% for r in records.all %}{% if r.copy -%}
/records/{{ r.id }}/source.{{ r.copy_url.split(".") | last }} {{ r.copy_url }} 301
{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% for name, url in ledger.archive_urls -%}
/ledger/archive/{{ name }} {{ url }} 301
{% endfor %}
